# rgbtorgba

- Label: RGB to RGBA
- Category: Copernicus (`Cop`), Houdini 22.0.368
- Inputs: 0 to 2
- Parameters: 1 (exact, read from Houdini by hython)
- Used by the height graph: no

## Feature summary (web, SideFX reference)

- Source: https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/cop/rgbtorgba.html
- Summary (EN): The RGB to RGBA node combines an RGB layer or attribute with a mono layer that supplies the alpha channel, producing an RGBA result.
- Résumé (FR) : Le nœud RGB to RGBA assemble une couche RGB et une couche mono d'alpha en une couche RGBA, prémultipliée ou non selon son réglage.

- Inputs meaning: ["rgb: the RGB layer or attribute to join", "alpha: the mono layer or attribute used as the alpha channel"]

- Key parameters: ["Premultiply Alpha: when on, premultiplies the inputs to create an associated RGBA layer; when off, joins RGB and alpha directly"]

- Caveats: ["RGBA layers are usually premultiplied, and the output may be premultiplied depending on Premultiply Alpha"]

